        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Peixe Aquático. Uma membrana mucosa transparente cobre o corpo de Wooper. Tocá-lo com as mãos desprotegidas provoca dormência e formigamento. Quando caminha em terra firme, ele reveste o corpo com uma camada viscosa e venenosa.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Wooper pode evoluir para Quagsire no nível 7 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tail Whip, Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Mud Sport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Mud Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Mud Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Amnesia, Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Earthquake</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Toxic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Rain Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Haze, Mist, Muddy Water</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, After You, Amnesia, Aqua Tail, Attract, Avalanche, Blizzard, Body Slam, Bulldoze, Chilling Water, Confide, Curse, Dig, Dive, Double Team, Double-Edge, Earth Power, Earthquake, Eerie Impulse, Encore, Endure, Facade, Frustration, Guard Swap, Hail, Haze, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Infestation, Iron Tail, Liquidation, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Muddy Water, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Sandstorm, Scald, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Sludge Wave, Snore, Snowscape, Spikes, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acid Spray, After You, Ancient Power, Body Slam, Counter, Curse, Double Kick, Eerie Impulse, Encore, Guard Swap, Mud Sport, Power-Up Punch, Recover, Sleep Talk, Spit Up, Stockpile, Swallow</p>",
